<p>Each correct answer earns the points set for that question (normally 1). Wrong or missing answers earn nothing and never cost points.</p>
<p>Players are ranked by total score, highest first.</p>
<p>If scores are equal, the player with the <strong class="text-ink-100">lower total response time on their correct answers</strong> ranks higher. Response time is measured by the server, from when a question opens to when your answer is received.</p>
<p>Players who are still exactly tied share the same rank. Rules for splitting prizes between tied players are published with each prize competition.</p>
